{"card_id":"SYMPTOM_CHESTPAIN_001","card_group":"A_FN_hidden_risk","card_title":"胸痛/胸痛等效症状需要结构化缺血风险评估","clinical_problem":"用于临床症状提示可能存在心肌缺血或CAD风险时，防止仅凭ECG低证据或非特异性ECG表现进行过度下调。","applicable_when":"当 chest_pain_type、chest_pain_subtype 或 symptom_attack_status 提示胸痛、胸闷、气短、乏力、上腹/下颌/肩臂不适等可能缺血相关症状时。","key_evidence_summary":"2021 AHA/ACC胸痛指南强调，胸痛包含胸部疼痛以外的多种不适和心绞痛等效症状，并建议对急性或稳定胸痛使用基于证据的诊断流程进行结构化风险评估。该证据支持Agent2/Agent3在症状存在时保留或上调风险审查，而不是仅凭ECG低证据下调。","agent_action_hint":"preserve_score; mild_up_risk; hidden_high_risk_alert; require_structured_risk_review","blocked_action":"aggressive_down_correction; symptom_absence_inference; direct_CAG_prediction; LLM_generate_final_score","safety_level":"high","evidence_sources":"SRC_GUIDE_AHA_ACC_CHEST_PAIN_2021","source_excerpt_ids":"SUP_AHA_CHEST_2021_001; SUP_AHA_CHEST_2021_002","usage_boundary":"该卡只能说明症状需要结构化评估，不能单独证明CAG阳性；症状字段缺失时不能强触发。不得使用该卡直接预测CAG结局。","confidence_level":"high","status":"active_v2_candidate","notes":"上一轮已接受，本轮未改动。","required_evidence_concepts":[],"required_any_present_concepts":[],"required_all_present_concepts":[],"required_status":"present","forbidden_evidence_concepts":[],"forbidden_status":["absent","missing","unknown"],"applicable_branches":[],"allowed_query_purposes":["core_mechanism","branch_or_confounder","counterevidence"],"runtime_pool":"patient_medical","reviewer_status":"doctor_review_informed_v2_candidate","applicability_state":"standard","runtime_disposition":"KEEP_IN_RUNTIME"}
{"card_id":"SYMPTOM_CHESTPAIN_002","card_group":"A_FN_hidden_risk","card_title":"非典型症状不能直接等同低CAG风险","clinical_problem":"用于防止把非经典胸痛、伴随症状或糖尿病/老年/女性患者的非典型表现误解为低风险。","applicable_when":"当 chest_pain_subtype、symptom_attack_status 或人群背景提示症状不典型，但存在糖尿病、老年、女性或多危险因素背景时。","key_evidence_summary":"2021 AHA/ACC胸痛指南不鼓励使用“atypical”作为胸痛描述；女性、糖尿病患者和老年患者可出现非经典或伴随症状，如气短、恶心、乏力、头晕、晕厥前、上腹部不适等。因此，非经典症状不能被直接解释为低风险。","agent_action_hint":"preserve_score; mild_up_risk; hidden_high_risk_alert","blocked_action":"aggressive_down_correction; atypical_equals_low_risk; direct_CAG_prediction","safety_level":"high","evidence_sources":"SRC_GUIDE_AHA_ACC_CHEST_PAIN_2021","source_excerpt_ids":"SUP_AHA_CHEST_2021_003; SUP_AHA_CHEST_2021_004","usage_boundary":"该卡强调症状解释边界，不代表所有非典型症状均为冠脉病变；必须结合临床风险因素、ECG证据和模型分数关系。","confidence_level":"high","status":"active_v2_candidate","notes":"上一轮已接受，本轮未改动。","required_evidence_concepts":[],"required_any_present_concepts":[],"required_all_present_concepts":[],"required_status":"present","forbidden_evidence_concepts":[],"forbidden_status":["absent","missing","unknown"],"applicable_branches":[],"allowed_query_purposes":["core_mechanism","branch_or_confounder","counterevidence"],"runtime_pool":"patient_medical","reviewer_status":"doctor_review_informed_v2_candidate","applicability_state":"standard","runtime_disposition":"KEEP_IN_RUNTIME"}
{"card_id":"CLIN_RISK_DIABETES_001","card_group":"A_FN_hidden_risk","card_title":"糖尿病是ASCVD风险背景并常与多种危险因素聚集","clinical_problem":"用于识别 diabetes_history、GLU、HbA1c 等字段提示的临床高风险背景，防止ECG低证据时低估CAG风险。","applicable_when":"糖尿病史明确，并用于经验证临床可能性模型或与症状、ECG和其他风险因素联合解释时。","key_evidence_summary":"ADA 2026标准指出，糖尿病本身赋予独立ASCVD风险，且高血压、高脂血症、肥胖等主要心血管风险因素在糖尿病人群中常聚集。该证据支持糖尿病作为Agent2高风险背景。","agent_action_hint":"risk_context_only; include_in_validated_clinical_likelihood_model; preserve_score","blocked_action":"direct_CAG_prediction; LLM_generate_final_score; single_risk_factor_as_CAG_label; automatic_score_change","safety_level":"high","evidence_sources":"SRC_GUIDE_ADA_CVD_DIABETES_2026","source_excerpt_ids":"SUP_ADA_DM_CVD_2026_001","usage_boundary":"糖尿病本身不证明当前CAG阳性，不单独触发mild_up或block_down；长期危险因素管理不作为本项目运行时纠偏动作。","confidence_level":"high","status":"active_v2_candidate","notes":"吸收被排除的糖尿病长期预防总卡；改为纯风险背景，不单独上调。","required_evidence_concepts":[],"required_any_present_concepts":[],"required_all_present_concepts":[],"required_status":"present","forbidden_evidence_concepts":[],"forbidden_status":["absent","missing","unknown"],"applicable_branches":[],"allowed_query_purposes":["core_mechanism","branch_or_confounder","counterevidence"],"runtime_pool":"patient_medical","reviewer_status":"doctor_review_informed_v2_candidate","applicability_state":"standard","runtime_disposition":"KEEP_IN_RUNTIME"}
{"card_id":"CLIN_RISK_HTN_001","card_group":"A_FN_hidden_risk","card_title":"高血压和控制状态是ASCVD/CAD风险背景","clinical_problem":"用于Agent2解释hypertension_history、hypertension_duration_years、hypertension_control_status字段。","applicable_when":"高血压病史明确，并作为经验证临床可能性模型或多因素风险评估的一项输入时。","key_evidence_summary":"2019 ACC/AHA一级预防指南将高血压控制列为ASCVD预防核心内容；ADA 2026指出高血压在糖尿病人群中常见，并是ASCVD、心衰和微血管并发症的重要风险因素。该证据支持高血压作为临床风险背景。","agent_action_hint":"risk_context_only; include_in_validated_clinical_likelihood_model; preserve_score","blocked_action":"direct_CAG_prediction; LLM_generate_final_score; single_risk_factor_as_CAG_label; automatic_score_change","safety_level":"medium-high","evidence_sources":"SRC_GUIDE_ACC_AHA_PRIMARY_PREVENTION_2019; SRC_GUIDE_ADA_CVD_DIABETES_2026","source_excerpt_ids":"SUP_ACC_AHA_PREVENTION_2019_004; SUP_ADA_DM_CVD_2026_005","usage_boundary":"单独高血压不触发CAG上调或阻断下调；控制状态用于长期风险背景。","confidence_level":"medium-high","status":"active_v2_candidate","notes":"高血压仅进入经验证多因素模型，不单独改变CAG分数。","required_evidence_concepts":[],"required_any_present_concepts":[],"required_all_present_concepts":[],"required_status":"present","forbidden_evidence_concepts":[],"forbidden_status":["absent","missing","unknown"],"applicable_branches":[],"allowed_query_purposes":["core_mechanism","branch_or_confounder","counterevidence"],"runtime_pool":"patient_medical","reviewer_status":"doctor_review_informed_v2_candidate","applicability_state":"standard","runtime_disposition":"KEEP_IN_RUNTIME"}
{"card_id":"CLIN_LIKELIHOOD_001","card_group":"A_FN_hidden_risk","card_title":"疑似慢性冠脉综合征应基于症状、ECG、生化和临床可能性分层","clinical_problem":"用于让Agent3在ECG与临床证据不一致时，按照临床可能性而非单一模态分数进行全局审查。","applicable_when":"当存在稳定胸痛/劳力性症状、临床风险因素或锁定 ECG 分数与临床证据明显不一致时。","key_evidence_summary":"2024 ESC CCS指南的初始管理流程包括病史、症状、体格检查、静息ECG、生化检查，并进一步评估阻塞性CAD临床可能性。该证据支持把Agent2风险因素、ECG证据和locked ECG score共同纳入全局状态计算。","agent_action_hint":"preserve_score; mild_up_risk; require_global_consistency_check","blocked_action":"single_modality_down_correction; direct_CAG_prediction; ignore_clinical_context","safety_level":"high","evidence_sources":"SRC_GUIDE_ESC_CCS_2024","source_excerpt_ids":"SUP_ESC_CCS_2024_001","usage_boundary":"该卡用于结构化诊断思路，不替代真实临床诊断路径；不能把临床可能性等同于CAG标签。","confidence_level":"high","status":"active_v2_candidate","notes":"上一轮已接受，本轮未改动。","required_evidence_concepts":[],"required_any_present_concepts":[],"required_all_present_concepts":[],"required_status":"present","forbidden_evidence_concepts":[],"forbidden_status":["absent","missing","unknown"],"applicable_branches":[],"allowed_query_purposes":["core_mechanism","branch_or_confounder","counterevidence"],"runtime_pool":"patient_medical","reviewer_status":"doctor_review_informed_v2_candidate","applicability_state":"standard","runtime_disposition":"KEEP_IN_RUNTIME"}
